    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the FrogLake<br><br>In this RPG you have to save your lake from drying up. <br>During your journey you will develop your special water powers and find better gear to move on. <br>The combat system of this game requires you to select 2 action keybinds every turn that you can perform <br>like: <br>Attack Jump Skill Item and Run.<br><br>Featuring:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique combat system<br></li><li>A big lake to explore<br></li><li>Lots of slippy friends to meet<br></li><li>Water based magic<br></li><li>Catching food with your tongue<br></li><li>Lots of sidequests</li></ul><br>Not featuring:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A level system<br></li><li>Random encounters<br></li><li>A stable housing market<br></li><li>Auto saving (this is a good thing)</li></ul>",
